## Node.js / Dashboard (dashboard/)

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output (Vite). Note [Dd]ebug/ and [Rr]elease/ above do not cover this.
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/

# Vite / tooling caches
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
